name: ['Ancient Den', 'Ardent Recruit', 'Argent Sphinx', 'Arrest', 'Barter in Blood', "Black Sun's Zenith", 'Blinkmoth Nexus', 'Bonesplitter', 'Coastal Tower', 'Condemn', 'Contagion Clasp', 'Darksteel Gargoyle', 'Darksteel Sentinel', 'Desecration Elemental', 'Diabolic Servitude', 'Dispatch', 'Drooling Groodion', 'Duplicant', 'Exhume', 'Flesh-Eater Imp', 'Forbidding Watchtower', 'Forest', 'Fume Spitter', 'Glimmerpoint Stag', 'Gold Myr', 'Grafted Exoskeleton', 'Grand Architect', 'Innocent Blood', 'Island', 'Kuldotha Forgemaster', 'Lumengrid Gargoyle', 'Memnite', 'Mitotic Slime', 'Morbid Plunder', 'Mortarpod', 'Myr Retriever', 'Myr Sire', 'Necroskitter', 'Neurok Stealthsuit', 'One Dozen Eyes', 'Phyrexian Altar', 'Phyrexian Ghoul', 'Phyrexian Juggernaut', 'Phyrexian Plaguelord', 'Plague Myr', 'Plaguemaw Beast', 'Plains', 'Platinum Angel', 'Protean Hulk', 'Purge', 'Putrefy', 'Reprocess', 'Rot Wolf', 'Seat of the Synod', 'Silent Arbiter', 'Silver Myr', 'Slagwurm Armor', 'Soul Snuffers', 'Spawning Pit', 'Spire Serpent', 'Spread the Sickness', 'Steel Wall', "Steelshaper's Gift", 'Stoic Rebuttal', 'Swamp', 'Symbiotic Elf', 'Tainted Wood', 'Talisman of Progress', 'Terramorphic Expanse', 'Test of Faith', 'Thirst for Knowledge', 'Thunderstaff', 'Trinket Mage', 'Triumph of the Hordes', 'Turn the Tide', 'Vedalken Certarch', 'Viridian Claw', 'Viridian Corrupter', 'Viridian Emissary', "White Sun's Zenith"]
